Feature:

Background: This executes once per feature file
	Given these properties
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|testray.component.names|Categories|
		|testray.main.component.name|Categories|

Setup: This executes before each scenario 
	Given TestCase set Up Portal Instance
	When User first Login PG

Teardown: This executes after each scenario 
	Given PortalInstances tear Down CP
		|testPortalInstance|TestPropsUtil#get('test.portal.instance')|
Scenario: Add Categories
Priority: 4
	Given Navigator open URL
	When ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Categories|
	And Vocabulary add CP
		|vocabularyName|Vocabulary Name|
	And Navigator open URL
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Categories|
	And Category add CP
		|categoryName|Category Name 1|
		|vocabularyName|Vocabulary Name|
	And Navigator open URL
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Categories|
	And Category add CP
		|categoryName|Category Name 2|
		|vocabularyName|Vocabulary Name|
	And Navigator open URL
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Categories|
	And Category add CP
		|categoryName|Category Name 3|
		|vocabularyName|Vocabulary Name|
	And Navigator open URL
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Categories|
	And Category view CP
		|categoryName|Category Name 1|
		|vocabularyName|Vocabulary Name|
	And Navigator open URL
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Categories|
	And Category view CP
		|categoryName|Category Name 2|
		|vocabularyName|Vocabulary Name|
	And Navigator open URL
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Categories|
	Then Category view CP
