Scenario: Delete Associated Asset Type Via Vocabulary
Priority: 3
	Given Navigator open URL
	When ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Categories|
	And VocabularyNavigator goto Add
	And PortletEntry input Name
		|name|Vocabulary Name|
	And Vocabulary add Associated Asset Type
		|assetType|Blogs Entry|
		|required|true|
	And Button click Add Row
	And Vocabulary add Associated Asset Type
		|assetType|Web Content Article|
		|required|true|
		|rowNumber|2|
	And Button click Save
	And Vocabulary delete Associated Asset Type Via Vocabulary CP
		|vocabularyName|Vocabulary Name|
	Then Vocabulary view With Associated Asset Type CP
		|vocabularyAssociatedAssetType|Blogs Entry|
		|vocabularyName|Vocabulary Name|
